++ * ```
++ * A BULLET THE FUNCTION CANNOT CLASSIFY IS `prose`, NEVER A GUESSED ROW.
++ * A ROW ON A VAGUE SENTENCE BLOCKS LEGITIMATE WORK AND CANNOT SAY WHY.
++ * ```
